    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69147" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῠλόομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύλη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be hardened, cicatrized</i>, of wounds, 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμυκώθη</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.40
			</span></i>, as read by <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμυλώθη: ἐτυλώθη</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> μυλοῦνται</span> is prob. cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολοῦνται</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				501
			</span></i>.</div>
